graph TD
    A["Paper Scout Initialization"] -->|Load context bundle| B["Configure Search Parameters"]
    B -->|Set categories & date range| C["Discovery Phase"]
    
    C -->|Query bioRxiv API| D["Retrieve Paper Metadata"]
    D -->|Extract DOIs & abstracts| E["Initial Triage"]
    E -->|Filter by basic relevance| F{Papers Found?}
    
    F -->|Yes| G["Analysis Phase"]
    F -->|No| H["Report: No results"]
    
    G -->|Score each paper| I["Relevance Scoring Engine"]
    I -->|Apply rubric weights| J["Generate Relevance Scores"]
    J -->|Extract concepts| K["Keyword & Topic Analysis"]
    K -->|Map to clusters| L["Thematic Clustering"]
    
    L -->|Sort by composite score| M["Curation Phase"]
    M -->|Rank papers| N["Create Summary Briefs"]
    N -->|Flag high-relevance| O["Integration Phase"]
    
    O -->|Query Zotero| P["Check Collection Status"]
    P -->|Add papers| Q["Write to Zotero Collections"]
    Q -->|Add tags & notes| R["Annotate Entries"]
    R -->|Generate metrics| S["Create Team Report"]
    
    S -->|Output artifacts| T["Discovery Summary CSV"]
    S -->|Output artifacts| U["Curated Papers List"]
    S -->|Output artifacts| V["Cluster Analysis"]
    S -->|Output artifacts| W["Integration Log"]
    
    T --> X["Final Report: Complete"]
    U --> X
    V --> X
    W --> X
    H --> X

    style A fill:#e1f5ff
    style C fill:#fff3e0
    style G fill:#f3e5f5
    style M fill:#e8f5e9
    style O fill:#fce4ec
    style X fill:#e0f2f1
